3. 
User enters a website URL.
>Browser finds the website's IP address using DNS.
>Browser sends an HTTP request to the web server.
>Server processes the request.
>Server retrieves data from the database if needed.
>Server sends HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files.
>Browser renders the webpage.
>User sees the webpage on the screen

